        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business strategy is to develop and seek regulatory approval to market pelareorep in an effective and timely manner, seek partnerships or transactions that allow for faster and more efficient development of pelareorep than we might be able to accomplish on our own, and access additional technologies at a time and in a manner that we believe is best for our development.",
        "start_character": 2740,
        "end_character": 3115
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We rely on our patent portfolio to protect the development of pelareorep.",
        "start_character": 18397,
        "end_character": 18470
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We rely on third parties to monitor, support, conduct, and oversee clinical trials of the product candidate that we are developing and, in some cases, to maintain regulatory files for our product candidate.",
        "start_character": 55110,
        "end_character": 55317
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We rely on third-party manufacturers to produce our clinical product supply and on other third parties to test, package, store, monitor, and transport bulk drug substance and drug product.",
        "start_character": 54797,
        "end_character": 54986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We will need additional financing in the future to fund the research and development of our product candidate and to meet our ongoing capital requirements.",
        "start_character": 52283,
        "end_character": 52439
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also have patents covering methods for manufacturing pelareorep and screening for susceptibility to pelareorep.",
        "start_character": 18711,
        "end_character": 18825
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company developing pelareorep, a well-tolerated intravenously delivered immunotherapeutic agent that selectively replicates in RAS-mutated tumors and activates the innate and adaptive immune systems and weakens tumor defense mechanisms.",
        "start_character": 34,
        "end_character": 312
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have attempted to mitigate this risk by identifying an alternative toll manufacturer, establishing stability profiles for long-term storage of pelareorep, and producing sufficient pelareorep in advance of patient enrollment in a particular clinical trial.",
        "start_character": 33667,
        "end_character": 33925
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have not been profitable since our inception and expect to continue to incur substantial losses as we continue research and development efforts.",
        "start_character": 1465,
        "end_character": 1612
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We primarily use one toll manufacturer in the U.S.",
        "start_character": 33325,
        "end_character": 33375
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
        "accession_number": "0001129928-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "•We may not achieve our projected development milestones in the time frames we announce and expect.",
        "start_character": 52009,
        "end_character": 52108
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001129928-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001129928-26-000020-c92d576c9a22e6bc",
